            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Sure, here's how it works now:\r\n```python\r\ni = [1, 2, 3]\r\n\r\n# mini.splitjoin\r\n\r\ni = [\r\n    1,\r\n    2,\r\n    3,\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\r\nand after would have the hanging indent on the closing `]`:\r\n```python\r\ni = [1, 2, 3]\r\n\r\n# mini.splitjoin\r\n\r\ni = [\r\n    1,\r\n    2,\r\n    3,\r\n    ]\r\n```",
